# Stratosoarer {4}{U}: "When this creature enters, target creature gains flying until end of turn" (CR 702.9b, 611.2a). On turn 3 Black Lotus, Mox Sapphire and
# Mox Jet pay the five; Mox Jet (not a creature) is refused as a target and Bot2's Elvish Mystic is accepted, so "target creature" does not care whose it is.
# The Mystic flies for the rest of that turn and no longer does on Bot2's turn.

